   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MoodCraft · Remix several images (Flux Klein)\n\nEach Load Image is a numbered reference: image 1 is the one being edited, image 2 (and more, wired to images.image2...) give parts to borrow. Refer to them by number in the prompt.\n\nModels (Flux 3 Image Klein, int8): diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-int8-convrot.safetensors, text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (type flux3), vae/flux2-vae.safetensors.\n\nSame graph MoodCraft queues; the app fills in prompt, seed, size and images itself. Core ComfyUI nodes only."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
